Package: zplexpress
Version: __VERSION__
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: nodejs (>= 18.0.0), cups, cups-client, xdg-utils
Suggests: ocom-ocbp-t4201-driver (>= 1.0.3)
Maintainer: Louis Nyirongo <louisnyirongo@lukeinternational.no>
Homepage: https://github.com/malawi-ministry-of-health-dhd/zplexpress
Description: ZPL/EPL-aware service for ARGOX, ZEBRA, and OCOM printers
 A Node.js service that detects ZPL and EPL commands received over HTTP and
 prints through CUPS. ARGOX and ZEBRA receive raw commands, while supported
 OCOM ZPL and EPL jobs can be rendered locally to exact-size PDF. OCOM ZPL
 jobs can alternatively use the installed native ZPL-to-TSPL translator.
